Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a journey out to see the\Nworld While I'm on my own I've
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.42,0:00:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,yet to reach the end So won't\Nyou come along with me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely then we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me now as we\Njourney on from sea to sea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,For that treasure known\Nby everybody as one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though they laugh and\Nsay it's just a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We are going, there's no doubt we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we can feel the\Nrush of energy overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It will lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pretending that you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Books will only get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No guides for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry soon, the rain\Nwill be gone with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.06,0:01:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your chin up, raise the\Nanchor, now that's what you'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.68,0:01:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it time and calm the storm\Nthat you have built within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and have my board at number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Once tomorrow's wind picks up,\Nwe set stuff cause we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thresh enough, stand tall and\Ntake a look at one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.38,0:01:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All the journey makes\Nme wanna see somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There are things out there\Nyou just won't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.38,0:01:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Most will believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.14,0:01:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am on a journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.86,0:01:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.86,0:01:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The world done on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,On my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.71,0:01:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my group of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Together we've got our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Says your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.10,0:01:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says it can't be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't even tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta just believe we'll\Nmake it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanna do it all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Together surely we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this moment in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.82,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this feeling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.26,0:02:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.86,0:02:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.02,0:02:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The Great Master Cat Viper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I just know you're going to love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.30,0:02:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel it in my bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.66,0:02:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I like him so much that I\Ndecided to write a little song about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.80,0:02:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go meet Master Cat Viper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He will know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go meet Master Cat Piper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.08,0:03:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He will know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.60,0:03:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go meet Master Cat Piper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.22,0:03:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He will know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.68,0:03:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go meet Master Cat Piper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He will know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go meet Master Catbifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.12,0:03:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He will know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.78,0:03:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go meet Master Catbifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.26,0:03:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He will know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.58,0:03:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, we found no traces of Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Or cedar—what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.86,0:03:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they take him against his will?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no—he chose to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanda carrot,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.34,0:04:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,it's hard I know, but\Nthis is their business;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.12,0:04:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,just let it go for their sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of Peck homes here\Ntoo—let's not worry the daytime folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't have to,\Nthank you guys; really,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.06,0:04:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,come now—your crew displayed great compassion\Nfor our people in their time of need;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,we really should be thanking you,\Ngala—is that about the tommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.58,0:04:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the master is a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.22,0:04:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,lonely man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.13,0:04:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's sad but true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.62,0:04:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had a heart
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,inside of these ribs,\Nit would break in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the master keeps a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.06,0:04:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,vigil at night, trying not to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:04:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,As
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:05:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,he looks up at
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the sparkling moon, with a star in his
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Still the master bears his
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,powerful fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.06,0:05:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As he waits for the sun,\Nstanding guard to help the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.34,0:05:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,people he loves—till the night is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.24,0:05:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,a nice song!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,is done
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.14,0:05:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nice song Is Cat Viper\Nreally such a romantic character?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.02,0:05:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, decidedly not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.62,0:05:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then what was the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a song or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure he's gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.26,0:05:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, going to see\Ngirls is, like, his thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.84,0:06:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he could have\Nmeant something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just, he really seemed\Nlike his mind was made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.74,0:06:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe he'll come back with Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji. Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.78,0:06:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What then we'd have a new Gourmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.06,0:06:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The trouble is the bride\Nis an emperor's daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,so if this union takes place, we'll\Nbecome big mom subordinates huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.48,0:06:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.48,0:06:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that appeared to be the\Nway Sanji felt about it too;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.60,0:06:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,he refused them without\Na moment's thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.04,0:06:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but then that's troubling in\Nitself if he couldn't turn down
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.96,0:06:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,the wedding invitation because\Nof who he's dealing with—what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You suppose he's going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have some idea;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,he's probably planning to uh, oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know what's up—he doesn't\Nwant to put his crewmates in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.10,0:06:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,so he's gonna find a\Nway to separate from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.44,0:06:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji quitting the straw\Nhats—that's the worst idea
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,ever—but that does make sense\Nnow that I think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He could have easily escaped when\Nhe tossed us out, based on the way
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the note was worded; I think he'd already\Nmade his decision to go alone, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's marrying big mom's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.76,0:07:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,daughter, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.67,0:07:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about getting cold feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.34,0:07:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be dead from hypothermia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.71,0:07:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And you said he's part of\Nthe Vinsmoke family, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.06,0:07:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like they're probably\Nthe key of solving this mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know his mom or his dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.92,0:07:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,or if he has siblings or\Nwhat—all I know is that they
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,moved from the north blue to\Nthe east blue a while back,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and now they live in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They've really done some\Ntraveling over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then smoke—I believe that I've heard\Nof them. I feel terrible; I wish we
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.02,0:07:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,could
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,have kept him from
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.78,0:07:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving until you guys got there,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but it was so quick at the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.06,0:07:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji made his own choice;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:08:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,there was nothing you could have\Ndone, so don't blame yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.32,0:08:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but either way—what if that\Nwas the last time we'll ever see Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.94,0:08:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd be just fine with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.22,0:08:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey no! Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If he was gonna leave the crew forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you think the letter should have\Nsaid thank you guys for everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and he should have apologized for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.06,0:08:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,everything and he should have apologized\Nfor for being such a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, that's not the point at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.20,0:08:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.68,0:08:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're like an unstoppable\Ntrain heading for disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what Caesar said about Smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,When Doflamingo was dealing\Nthose artificial devil fruits,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.52,0:08:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,his biggest trade partner was Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.16,0:08:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo was pissed when we\Ndestroyed the lab back on Punk Hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And then we destroyed\Nthe factory on Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So the next guy who's gonna get upset
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.28,0:08:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,is the Emperor Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:09:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't ignore this\Nguy now that we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.44,0:09:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already butted heads with the\NBeast Pirates, and they answer to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.40,0:09:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack, the guy who wrecked\Nthis place, is a threat too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a matter of time\Nbefore they come for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason we allied with\NTraffy is for the battle ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.62,0:09:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but I think Kaido's\Nalso got it out for Kin'emon and his pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.56,0:09:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Like it or not, we're gonna have to\Ngo toe-to-toe with him pretty soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.44,0:09:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We were already in hot\Nwater with one Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.40,0:09:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to that idiot\NCurly Browse to throw
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,another one into the mix\Nand make things worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an awful way to look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.40,0:09:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dumber than you look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.26,0:09:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two things may be bad,\Nbut they're not related, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.24,0:09:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That he never should have gotten himself
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.74,0:09:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,wrapped up in something\Nas stupid as matrimony.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.12,0:09:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.56,0:09:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please try not to get too heated, you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.68,0:09:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you to decide that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:10:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your place to say if\Nsomeone else's problem is stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.24,0:10:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Touchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.15,0:10:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, if we can't figure it out, then\Nwe'll just have to go and ask Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.06,0:10:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.97,0:10:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.68,0:10:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad idea, Luffy. You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just going to waltz\Nright up to Big Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.10,0:10:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we gotta go. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.00,0:10:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You might have forgotten this,\Nbut she does not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No offense, but we can't beat her with just\Nour crew, especially with your strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She's one of the four emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't be reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We've never faced anyone this strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, we gotta be sneaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.62,0:10:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And how are we supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.38,0:10:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I think of\Nit, I might know a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a way, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.74,0:10:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You may not know which direction Big Mom's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,subordinates headed\Nafter taking Sanji away,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but they did leave someone behind\Nwho's certain to be very knowledgeable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.84,0:11:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ergo, if that person is awake right\Nnow, he can tell us something helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep riding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see him shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, somebody\Nsure trashed this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The whale tree, it was already neat,\Nbut from up close it's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:12:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey look, they're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, there's Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.78,0:12:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.86,0:12:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.40,0:12:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.34,0:12:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.62,0:12:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like they're bouncing back quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.48,0:12:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat Luffy, it's us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.48,0:12:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about the fight before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.36,0:12:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to stop invaders\Nno matter who they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.96,0:12:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.86,0:12:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.40,0:12:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, is that cat guy around or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So our saviors are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We welcome you, Karoo and your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.68,0:12:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to express\Nour gratitude once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.84,0:12:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.94,0:12:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, my men attacked you, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.22,0:12:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They were merely acting out of\Nan abundance of caution. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.06,0:12:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you there indeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.16,0:12:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it from the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.78,0:13:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, see Beppo he.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and the rest of his group\Nare waiting in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.12,0:13:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.22,0:13:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But not right now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.36,0:13:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to talk to the Cat\NViper and the Lion Viper first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.86,0:13:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're referring to Peccoms, he's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to the back building.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.86,0:13:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're keeping that\Nwhole incident a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji is a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.52,0:13:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do whatever we can to help him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.10,0:13:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Cat Viper\Nin more ways than one,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't I go check on him first?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. Come, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me escort you, Tia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.32,0:13:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Chopper, you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.22,0:13:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:13:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.02,0:14:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.18,0:14:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Cat Viper is a little busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.54,0:14:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taking a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.02,0:14:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.54,0:14:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow, meow, meow, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.54,0:14:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow, meow, meow, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.52,0:14:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lasagne-ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in my meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.54,0:14:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tay, what's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't take a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wounds will reopen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.04,0:14:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And you need to eat lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.26,0:14:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you even holding that spoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.54,0:14:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just that, but I\Ndon't like taking orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.56,0:14:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,At least take doctor's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.56,0:14:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, he's bigger than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.04,0:14:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Like it or not, I don't have to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.90,0:15:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.74,0:15:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my choice. My.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.40,0:15:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get used to not having a left paw.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.88,0:15:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even clap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.66,0:15:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, who's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.06,0:15:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know you gotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.38,0:15:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The great Straw Hat Pirates, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the ones who saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.76,0:15:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, I promise I'll\Nrepay your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.34,0:15:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And I always keep my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.72,0:15:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm as driven as a man can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.16,0:15:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? A ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.88,0:15:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, uh, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.84,0:15:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, yay, time to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.00,0:15:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to rest, you big baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.73,0:15:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wound opened up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me make one thing abundantly clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I got in bed because I wanted to,\Nnot because I was feeling weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, sure. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever makes you stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.06,0:16:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes a shot, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you gotta, that\Nfoxtail, wave it in my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.26,0:16:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo, Fluffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.72,0:16:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.02,0:16:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Chopper,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,go ahead and give me the shot while\NI'm enjoying this little distraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.56,0:16:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I would if you stopped moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.58,0:16:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're afraid of a little needle?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.18,0:16:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.18,0:16:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm completely cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.02,0:16:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If there was a drug that good, I'd\Nhave knocked you out with it by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not hit injured people!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.02,0:16:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This big Fall sure tickles my funny bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.20,0:17:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I just love him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.66,0:17:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you survived that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.68,0:17:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My ability blocked half\Nof this attack! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.58,0:17:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pal Blackleg is probably long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nowhere he's ever getting out\Nof that wedding ceremony now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it that's trying\Nto make him get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.64,0:17:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji would never pick just one girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.16,0:17:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There was an agreement\Nmade between our mama
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.06,0:17:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and the patriarch of the Vinsmoke family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.48,0:17:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean Sanji's father?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.60,0:17:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So what kind of a person is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got quite a reputation\Nin the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with\Na group who goes by the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.86,0:17:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,name of Germa Double Six aka the\Nwarmongers? I've heard. Of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.66,0:17:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but they're an evil army\Nfrom a fairy tale, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.48,0:17:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.76,0:17:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That organization's as real as you or I,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:18:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Vinsmoke family sits\Nat the top of it, not only.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.34,0:18:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Only that, their leader happens to\Nbe your pal Black Lake's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.14,0:18:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you all to know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I never meant to hide anything\Nfrom my friends, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.66,0:18:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you heard anything about them, you\Nprobably know the Vinsmooks are bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.70,0:18:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a vicious group of assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji is from a family of assassins?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.48,0:18:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking\Nabout, and I don't care either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.48,0:18:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I expected as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.62,0:18:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one thing matters here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Sanji coming back to us or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.12,0:18:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter to\Nme if he gets married.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.62,0:18:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.86,0:19:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,if you think that means we're going to\Nwork under Big Mom, then you're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine with making an alliance,\Nbut you guys got to work under us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.18,0:19:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I need to call the doctor back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.44,0:19:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so funny, Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You better watch that tongue,\Nbrat, because I'll rack you! Gecko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you guys an all,\Nbut don't push your luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.42,0:19:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's an emperor, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And you want to be the boss? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a timeout.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.52,0:19:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little eyeballs are funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.14,0:19:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, either way, he's not getting\Nout of this marriage. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.68,0:19:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Lake had the right\Nidea of giving himself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.58,0:20:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can turn down an invitation\Nto one of Mama's tea parties,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.68,0:20:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what the reason might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.42,0:20:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody puts Mama to shame,\Nnot without paying the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.24,0:20:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A couple of days after they\Ndon't show up at the party,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's would-be guest\Ngets a surprise present.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.64,0:20:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you it's the last\Nthing anyone would want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They get a box with a loved\None's decapitated head in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.70,0:20:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be one of your heads if Mama\Nsaw fit to hunt your crewmates down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe it'd be the head\Nof one of Black Lake's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.98,0:20:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,old pals from the\Nrestaurant in the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.42,0:20:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Or she could kill someone in the\NKamabaka kingdom who trained him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.78,0:20:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.69,0:20:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you guys even know\Nall this stuff about Zod?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.70,0:20:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what true power can accomplish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.62,0:20:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.02,0:21:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what they must have told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.52,0:21:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.74,0:21:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause you know when someone as strong\Nas Mama makes a threat like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.26,0:21:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gotta follow through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.80,0:21:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why everyone bows down to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.32,0:21:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why no one can fight\Nagainst the four emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.46,0:21:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the weight of absolute power that\Nbrings even the strong to their knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji knew the stakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.60,0:21:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't go by choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One more thing maybe\Nthis will put you at ease
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,for what it's worth once\Nthis plays out you won't
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,be forced to work onto\NMama get out this marriage
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.78,0:21:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,is strictly political\Nif Mama wants someone
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.20,0:21:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,to be part of her crew\Nshe wants them to be
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,part of her bloodline as\Nwell in other words this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.90,0:21:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,marriage is ritual to\Nforge a bond between the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.24,0:21:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke family and the\NCharlotte family that's all
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.92,0:21:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so from this point on\Nit's got nothing to do
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.20,0:22:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,with you guys you really\Nwant me to spell this out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.78,0:22:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,for you from the moment\Nthat this marriage goes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.94,0:22:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,off Black Lake Sanji will\Nno longer be a member of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.82,0:22:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,with the Straw Hat crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.56,0:22:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of stupid rule is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.10,0:22:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji's my friend, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.48,0:22:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he's the son of the\NVinsmoke family before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.58,0:22:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't get mad at me. Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.98,0:22:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Sanji would\Nagree to a marriage like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.72,0:22:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in the face of Mama and\Nthe vicious Vinsmoke family?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.06,0:22:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.48,0:22:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I doubt he'll live long\Nenough to tell the tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.60,0:22:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.22,0:22:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.60,0:22:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.50,0:22:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I'm feeling up to\Nit, I'm going back to Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.28,0:22:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond that, I still got to settle\Nthings with that damn Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.26,0:22:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be surprised to see I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.06,0:22:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.98,0:22:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You can take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.36,0:23:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.27,0:23:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'm going without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.02,0:23:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with Robin on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.62,0:23:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If we go together, it'll be like\Nwe're trying to start a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.00,0:23:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to be\Ngetting into a big fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.08,0:23:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.58,0:23:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If I stick with this guy,\NI can crash the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.78,0:23:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need to do right now\Nis stop Sanji's wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.32,0:23:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.50,0:23:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna harbor an enemy\Njust because you say so!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.40,0:23:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.50,0:23:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.62,0:23:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't some joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.08,0:23:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so it's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.06,0:23:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.42,0:23:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the chopper, he'll heal you fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.74,0:23:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I never agreed to anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.66,0:23:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.16,0:23:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.80,0:23:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Zoro, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.42,0:23:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear about the wedding stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.30,0:23:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.40,0:23:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worried about Sanji too, aren't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.42,0:23:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to cut you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.40,0:24:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who said we\Nshould forget about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.90,0:24:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.66,0:24:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Zoro, how's\NPeckham's? Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.88,0:24:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good, you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.68,0:24:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Peckham's is bleeding a\Nlot and yelling and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.30,0:24:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Banging his head a bunch, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.84,0:24:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Better fix him quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.24,0:24:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are some serious symptoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.56,0:24:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll check him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.46,0:24:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you, Baron Corbett!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.54,0:24:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.86,0:24:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.77,0:24:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta must be Straw Hat Luffy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.84,0:24:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been eager to meet you, gotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.52,0:24:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.43,0:24:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you out of bed again?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.14,0:24:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.05,0:24:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.97,0:24:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all better now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.40,0:24:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not how it works!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.78,0:24:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.06,0:24:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's Cat Viper, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.74,0:24:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a monster cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.26,0:24:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.82,0:24:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow, meow, my meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.38,0:24:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A thank you, Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.12,0:24:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.24,0:25:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got double fountains of blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.72,0:25:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to guard you\Nto death, do it without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.30,0:25:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with us, Cat Viper, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.72,0:25:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.54,0:25:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll need another transfusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.14,0:25:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you bring me some blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.44,0:25:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you need, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.80,0:25:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.94,0:25:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, uh, doctor, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.06,0:25:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.44,0:25:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, cat, get up. We're gonna fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.18,0:25:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, whoa, he's in bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.80,0:25:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.76,0:25:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, is that your crew with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.18,0:25:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, they wanted to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.70,0:25:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the Heart\NPirates, 20 members strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.90,0:25:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for taking care\Nof our Captain Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.12,0:25:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.76,0:26:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's talk in private.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.26,0:26:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you gotta disrespect us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.42,0:26:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not having a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.76,0:26:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're not friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.96,0:26:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're strategic allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.82,0:26:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.32,0:26:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.23,0:26:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackleg agreed to Big Mom's plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.74,0:26:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, and you all just\Nstood there and let it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.40,0:26:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.31,0:26:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go take him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.36,0:26:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.64,0:26:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So do you mind if we hold off\Non fighting Kaido for a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.76,0:26:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.58,0:26:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Any way around it, it's only a matter\Nof time before Kaido comes for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.00,0:26:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My original plan was to hide\Nout here in Zo for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.26,0:26:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but now that they know\Nwhere we are, we're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.90,0:26:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They come back for us and\Ninvade this country and
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.94,0:26:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,it's people will suffer and\Nit will all be our fault
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.96,0:27:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd they come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.32,0:27:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're true.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.54,0:27:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pirates, but you're all so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.70,0:27:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks you God for caring about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.84,0:27:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made us so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.74,0:27:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't thank you, Tia, enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.64,0:27:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pucci, what happened? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.28,0:27:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.74,0:27:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.12,0:27:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's have a party!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.54,0:27:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for some barbecue!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.36,0:27:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.64,0:27:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.26,0:27:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.30,0:28:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It would appear that Luffy and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.34,0:28:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,have completely forgotten\Nabout our situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.52,0:28:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so it falls upon us, mature\Nadults, to handle things properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.20,0:28:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Very true, but we can\Nintercept the problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.14,0:28:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,uh, we just gotta keep those samurai out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.30,0:28:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, since Raizo isn't here,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.80,0:28:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no need for Kin'emon and Kanjuro\Nto enter the country in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.04,0:28:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're blameless in this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.68,0:28:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But the whole city was destroyed\Nbecause of their friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.80,0:28:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring Raizo to me or face destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.26,0:28:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the Wano Warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.62,0:28:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They were so kind to us even\Nafter all they've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.28,0:29:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can't let them find out\Nthat we're friends with samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.24,0:29:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It might just break their\Nfluffy little hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.22,0:29:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Or worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.58,0:29:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,they find out that Kin'emon and his bros\Nwere going to use this place as their.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.04,0:29:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,rendezvous point.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.54,0:29:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,These minks are kind-hearted folks,\Nbut that would piss anyone off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.90,0:29:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Last thing I want is to\Nfight with our new pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.04,0:29:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They've suffered enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.14,0:29:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It might not be much fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.24,0:29:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,but we got to make sure those samurai\Ndon't sneak in and ruin everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.98,0:29:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I would scarcely call it record time,\Nbut we've made it before dawn at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.18,0:29:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The trial is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.14,0:30:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,At long last, our courage has won the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.80,0:30:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This has been quite the\Nmisadventure, though, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.28,0:30:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The others must be quite worried about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.70,0:30:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I do hope they're in good health.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.24,0:30:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel a bit guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.78,0:30:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we shan't keep\Nthem waiting much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.54,0:30:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What a fine tiger you\Nare, Torosaburo A tiger?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.18,0:30:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, a tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.92,0:30:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The color threw me off a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.82,0:30:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet we must all say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.20,0:30:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear monkey fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.60,0:30:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please pardon my rudeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.16,0:30:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have yet to answer our inquiry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.74,0:30:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I must know if a warrior\Nnamed Race can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.54,0:30:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not this monkey's business!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.38,0:30:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you perspiring\Nso profusely, my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.32,0:31:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.46,0:31:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you flee?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.00,0:31:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We require your assistance\Nin finding Race.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.20,0:31:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, monkey fellow!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.70,0:31:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be our guide!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.04,0:31:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Bananas!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.88,0:31:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Samurai have appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.58,0:31:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to report this!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.44,0:31:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Samurai have come to zone!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.38,0:31:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You
